--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ADR / parity notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 - ADR-002/006: stateless OnboardingPageScreen (OnboardingPageContent) + OnboardingPageViewModel (S8); no
   business logic in composables — the steps useMemo + footer branch live in the framework-free model.
 - ADR-004: binds the shared KMP OnboardingStore (GET /onboarding/status) via OnboardingPageSource; no HTTP
   in the view. Gate fields are non-unit-bearing -> no SI conversion (ADR-005 boundary N/A).
 - ADR-011: no placeholders/stubs (placeholder gate = 0).
 - ADR-013: cache-then-network UiState (loading/content/stale/offline/error); the gate carries pessimistic
   defaults so the checklist never blanks (web "assume not complete on failure").
 - ADR-014: every visible literal via stringResource(R.string.translation_onboarding_*) (25/25 verified).
 - ADR-015: TalkBack pane title (paneTitle = welcome), link role semantics, skip-hint Tooltip, Material 3
   theme/colorScheme tokens (light/dark/dynamic), >= 48dp button targets.
 - Navigation seam: no LocalNavController is exposed to page hosts (GlancePage/ArchivedPage precedent).
   In-app routes open via the registered deep-link scheme (teslasync://app/tesla-account, LocalUriHandler);
   "Continue/Skip" leave the standalone surface via the system back-dispatcher; docs open in the browser.

